==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|k|u}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*kooldak}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*kale-}}. Cognates include {{cog|mns|хо̄луӈкве|tr=χōluŋkwe, χōl-}} and {{cog|hu|hal}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fi-IPA|*}}
* {{rhymes|lang=fi|uolːɑ}}
* {{hyphenation|kuol|la|lang=fi}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{lb|fi|intransitive|_|(+ illative)}} to [[die]] (of/from)
#: ''[[isoäiti|Isoäiti]][[-ni|ni]] '''kuoli''' [[syöpä|syöpään]].''
#:: ''My grandmother '''died''' of cancer.''

